# The gate: the environment variable is read by the server process, so it must be set in the
# shell that starts Strata (strata\run-iq3_s-coding-reason.bat sets it). Unset = today's
# hard no-reasoning for both dialects; the template stays a second layer: without
# strata_allow_thinking it renders the closed empty <think></think> even if a caller passes
# enable_thinking=True. Apply with strata\patches\apply-no-reasoning.ps1 (idempotent, upgrades
# the older unconditional patch); revert with -Revert.
